    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B03b scope (consultation supporting)","items":["Completes B03-consultation-core. Modules: consultation-history (7/2), consultation-context-schema (9/1), consent (3/1), document-template (8/1), dna-writing-style (31/4) = 58 routes / 9 controllers (inventory).","History: user/admin consultation history endpoints. Context schema: admin + /tenants/me. Consent: /admin/consent-grants. Document template: admin + /tenants/me. DNA writing style: style CRUD, ingest/jobs, admin, memory-admin (4 controllers).","Grouped endpoint nodes used for readability; route-level details/examples summarized in cards."]},
